      "conversationId": "2755ade6-35e6-43c1-8b48-bdbff01bd3a5",
      "role": "assistant",
      "body": "**I’d hold off on outreach until we confirm the office and the ask.**\n\nThe approved memory I retrieved covers monthly-brief formatting, not direction to contact Office Delta. [4] Aster’s profile, strategy, correspondence, and outreach-history lookups were unavailable, so I couldn’t verify the relationship, prior commitments, or any contact restrictions.\n\n**Which office do you mean by “Office Delta,” and what would we ask it to do for Aster?** With that clarified, I can assess whether contact is warranted rather than recommend outreach on an unverified basis.\n\n> **Evidence limitation:** A delta is valid only between positions with the same fiscal year, funding scope, units, and compatible vehicle stages; that part of the answer remains limited because the source was never called.",
